usage: python -m orchestrator_harness [-h] [--config CONFIG]
                                      {scan,watch,handoff-preflight,adapter,view,source,lane,workspace} ...

Durable diagnostic observation and safe lane lifecycle boundaries

positional arguments:
  {scan,watch,handoff-preflight,adapter,view,source,lane,workspace}
    scan                print one reconciled snapshot
    watch               run a bounded diagnostic watch
    adapter             install or inspect a project-local host adapter
    view                allocate an exact retained-ref immutable source view
    workspace           provider-neutral workspace overlay lifecycle

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG
